[I] Modern terminal emulator

[T] Ghostty aims to be the best drop-in replacement for your current terminal
[T] emulator on macOS and Linux. Ghostty is fast, feature-rich, and has a
[T] platform-native GUI while being the most standards-compliant terminal
[T] emulator available.

[U] https://ghostty.org/

